# Dispatch Spec

## Driver schedules
- Lifecycle: `draft -> submitted -> approved -> locked`.
- After `locked`, only manager/dispatcher can override with mandatory reason.
- Validate on create and update.

## Conflict rules (must return `409`)
- One vehicle cannot be assigned to multiple drivers in overlapping time.
- One driver cannot be assigned to multiple vehicles in overlapping time.
- Re-check conflicts for every mutation.

## Attendance and HOS
- Attendance is the source of truth for working days (not planned schedule).
- Attendance adjustments require reason + audit.
- HOS pre-check must block unsafe/illegal assignments.

## Trip operations
- Enforce valid state transitions.
- Completed trips only enter payroll bonus source.
- Route deviation must be validated before final bonus/fuel impact.
